==Strategy==
Due to the presence of the red wind, it makes getting critical hitters that can handle the Metal Hippoes a problem. If you have [[Space Marine Cat]], you can stack it to beat the Metal Hippoes, otherwise you're just gonna have to grind it out. None of the enemies have significant amounts of damage, so high levels of [[Wall Cat]], or even the level 20 version, essentially makes it impossible for them to progress.

